OL,3,GNEWSA'Mum's death led me to choose
OL,4,Adouble mastectomy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreast cancer has been a constant in
OL,7,FEmily Hardaker's life since she was 14,
OL,8,Fwhen the disease took her mother's
OL,9,Flife.
OL,11,FIn 2017, when Hardaker was 25, she
OL,12,Ftested positive for a BRCA2 gene
OL,13,Fmutation, which meant she was at a
OL,14,Fsignificantly higher risk of developing
OL,15,Fthe condition herself.
OL,17,FThe 34-year-old from Brislington, in
OL,18,FBristol, decided to get a preventative
OL,19,Fdouble mastectomy two years ago to
OL,20,Freduce the risk.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
