OL,3,GNEWSA'Mum's death led me to choose
OL,4,Adouble mastectomy'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Seeing as that my mum had passed away,
OL,7,Fand my family were, I use the term
OL,8,F'riddled with it', which I know is not
OL,9,Ffunny, it was a no-brainer for me," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
